      "updated": 1785861122382,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "📌 What is an Activation Function & Why Non-Linearity Matters?",
      "fontSize": 22,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 18,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "📌 What is an Activation Function & Why Non-Linearity Matters?",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.3636363636363635
    },
    {
      "id": "oOzZngA3asj1q1D33N_oc",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -14510,
      "y": -13290,
      "width": 851.4846801757812,
      "height": 90,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#0f172a",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "H-AJiuUx2NOtWlgfNbbvQ",
      "index": "bB1",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1085151713,
      "version": 174,
      "versionNonce": 111431393,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785861122382,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• Applied to the weighted sum of inputs before producing the neuron's final output.\n• Introduces non-linearity; without it, the network acts like a simple linear regression model.\n• Enables curved decision boundaries needed to process complex data (images, NLP, speech processing).\n• Real-world data is rarely linearly separable.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 15,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• Applied to the weighted sum of inputs before producing the neuron's final output.\n• Introduces non-linearity; without it, the network acts like a simple linear regression model.\n• Enables curved decision boundaries needed to process complex data (images, NLP, speech processing).\n• Real-world data is rarely linearly separable.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
