      "index": "bBk",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1434220609,
      "version": 190,
      "versionNonce": 942423663,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785861122383,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "📐 Derivative & Vanishing Gradient Problem",
      "fontSize": 22,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 18,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "📐 Derivative & Vanishing Gradient Problem",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.3636363636363635
    },
    {
      "id": "AooCzAl_RHIhHN35pER5o",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -14530,
      "y": -10650,
      "width": 1040,
      "height": 40,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#0f172a",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "H-AJiuUx2NOtWlgfNbbvQ",
      "index": "bBl",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 581290017,
      "version": 190,
      "versionNonce": 1586521089,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785861122383,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "σ'(x) = σ(x) · (1 - σ(x))",
      "fontSize": 26,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 22,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "σ'(x) = σ(x) · (1 - σ(x))",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.5384615384615385
    },
    {
      "id": "_P3K49lbz1cnXQC6dF5h4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -14530,
      "y": -10590,
      "width": 512.4468994140625,
      "height": 233.75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#0f172a",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "H-AJiuUx2NOtWlgfNbbvQ",
      "index": "bBm",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1104813057,
      "version": 193,
      "versionNonce": 1545115791,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785861122383,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• Maximum derivative is at x=0 where σ'(0) = 0.25\n\n• As x → ±∞, σ'(x) → 0 (derivative approaches zero)\n\n• Vanishing Gradient Problem:\n  - In deep networks, gradients become extremely small (near zero)\n  - Weight updates during backpropagation become negligible\n  - Learning slows down or stops entirely\n  - This is a major issue for training deep neural networks\n\n• Practice: σ'(0) = 1/4, σ'(2) ≈ 0.1056, σ'(-1) ≈ 0.1966",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 14,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• Maximum derivative is at x=0 where σ'(0) = 0.25\n\n• As x → ±∞, σ'(x) → 0 (derivative approaches zero)\n\n• Vanishing Gradient Problem:\n  - In deep networks, gradients become extremely small (near zero)\n  - Weight updates during backpropagation become negligible\n  - Learning slows down or stops entirely\n  - This is a major issue for training deep neural networks\n\n• Practice: σ'(0) = 1/4, σ'(2) ≈ 0.1056, σ'(-1) ≈ 0.1966",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
