    {
      "id": "hPT55zYH8NN_4j1pzRUtx",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -14370,
      "y": -18810,
      "width": 580,
      "height": 260,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2d3436",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "vFDglZB8iOW2_peXRgBCX",
      "index": "bEQ",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 536552399,
      "version": 218,
      "versionNonce": 1932694977,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785862359021,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Hidden Layer Calculations:\n   h1 = i1 · w1 + i2 · w3 + b1\n   h2 = i1 · w2 + i2 · w4 + b1\n\n2. Output Before Activation (Linear):\n   z = h1 · w5 + h2 · w6 + b2\n\n3. Non-Linear Sigmoid Activation:\n   σ(x) = 1 / (1 + e⁻ˣ)\n   Final Output = σ(z)",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 15,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Hidden Layer Calculations:\n   h1 = i1 · w1 + i2 · w3 + b1\n   h2 = i1 · w2 + i2 · w4 + b1\n\n2. Output Before Activation (Linear):\n   z = h1 · w5 + h2 · w6 + b2\n\n3. Non-Linear Sigmoid Activation:\n   σ(x) = 1 / (1 + e⁻ˣ)\n   Final Output = σ(z)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.4444444444444444
    },
