      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785862359021,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Linear Activation Function (Identity Function)",
      "fontSize": 22,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 18,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Linear Activation Function (Identity Function)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.3636363636363635
    },
    {
      "id": "y09vWfCz6SW6tavPU6gDi",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -14830,
      "y": -18220,
      "width": 514.8507080078125,
      "height": 180,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2d3436",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "vFDglZB8iOW2_peXRgBCX",
      "index": "bET",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 402481711,
      "version": 223,
      "versionNonce": 1384394991,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785862359021,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• Mathematical Form: y = x (returns input as output)\n• Output Range: (-∞ to +∞)\n• Key Limitations:\n  - Stacked linear layers reduce down to a single linear function.\n  - Limits network capacity to learn complex relationships.\n• Common Use Cases:\n  - Output layer for regression tasks\n  - Combined with non-linear activation in hidden layers",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 15,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• Mathematical Form: y = x (returns input as output)\n• Output Range: (-∞ to +∞)\n• Key Limitations:\n  - Stacked linear layers reduce down to a single linear function.\n  - Limits network capacity to learn complex relationships.\n• Common Use Cases:\n  - Output layer for regression tasks\n  - Combined with non-linear activation in hidden layers",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
