      "text": "σ(x) = 1 / (1 + e⁻ˣ)",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 25,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "σ(x) = 1 / (1 + e⁻ˣ)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.4285714285714286
    },
    {
      "id": "YXVwNbDsen8u5mHHtwGJ9",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -14840,
      "y": -17240,
      "width": 543.0205688476562,
      "height": 292.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2d3436",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "vFDglZB8iOW2_peXRgBCX",
      "index": "bEi",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1355824655,
      "version": 239,
      "versionNonce": 501466273,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785862359021,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Key Properties:\n\n1. Domain: All real numbers (-∞ to +∞)\n\n2. Range: (0, 1) — maps any input to a probability-like output\n\n3. Asymptotes: Approaches 1 as x → +∞, approaches 0 as x → -∞\n\n4. Monotonicity: Strictly increasing function (derivative > 0 for all x)\n\n5. Differentiability: Smooth and differentiable everywhere\n\n6. Symmetry: σ(-x) = 1 - σ(x)",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 15,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Key Properties:\n\n1. Domain: All real numbers (-∞ to +∞)\n\n2. Range: (0, 1) — maps any input to a probability-like output\n\n3. Asymptotes: Approaches 1 as x → +∞, approaches 0 as x → -∞\n\n4. Monotonicity: Strictly increasing function (derivative > 0 for all x)\n\n5. Differentiability: Smooth and differentiable everywhere\n\n6. Symmetry: σ(-x) = 1 - σ(x)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
