      "text": "📐 Derivative & Vanishing Gradient Problem",
      "fontSize": 22,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 18,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "📐 Derivative & Vanishing Gradient Problem",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.3636363636363635
    },
    {
      "id": "yYeoj1DOqegWegNvYZ8Wc",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -14850,
      "y": -16430,
      "width": 1040,
      "height": 40,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2d3436",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "vFDglZB8iOW2_peXRgBCX",
      "index": "bEr",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1986086191,
      "version": 237,
      "versionNonce": 1832723055,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785862359022,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "σ'(x) = σ(x) · (1 - σ(x))",
      "fontSize": 26,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 22,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "σ'(x) = σ(x) · (1 - σ(x))",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.5384615384615385
    },
    {
      "id": "Hp6D4vHPIN4VELeVmaJsm",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -14850,
      "y": -16370,
      "width": 512.4468994140625,
      "height": 233.75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2d3436",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "vFDglZB8iOW2_peXRgBCX",
      "index": "bEs",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 58640207,
      "version": 240,
      "versionNonce": 1785708545,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785862359022,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• Maximum derivative is at x=0 where σ'(0) = 0.25\n\n• As x → ±∞, σ'(x) → 0 (derivative approaches zero)\n\n• Vanishing Gradient Problem:\n  - In deep networks, gradients become extremely small (near zero)\n  - Weight updates during backpropagation become negligible\n  - Learning slows down or stops entirely\n  - This is a major issue for training deep neural networks\n\n• Practice: σ'(0) = 1/4, σ'(2) ≈ 0.1056, σ'(-1) ≈ 0.1966",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 14,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• Maximum derivative is at x=0 where σ'(0) = 0.25\n\n• As x → ±∞, σ'(x) → 0 (derivative approaches zero)\n\n• Vanishing Gradient Problem:\n  - In deep networks, gradients become extremely small (near zero)\n  - Weight updates during backpropagation become negligible\n  - Learning slows down or stops entirely\n  - This is a major issue for training deep neural networks\n\n• Practice: σ'(0) = 1/4, σ'(2) ≈ 0.1056, σ'(-1) ≈ 0.1966",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
