      "text": "Formula: σ(z)ᵢ = eᶻⁱ / Σⱼ eᶻʲ  |  Converts raw logits vector into a valid probability distribution",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 16,
      "index": "bFv",
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Formula: σ(z)ᵢ = eᶻⁱ / Σⱼ eᶻʲ  |  Converts raw logits vector into a valid probability distribution",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.3333333333333333
    },
    {
