      "updated": 1785862356935,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Properties & Advantages:\n• Piecewise linear function\n• Derivative: 0 for x<0, 1 for x>0\n• Highly efficient computation & sparse activation\n• Fast convergence in SGD\n• Applications: CNNs, MLPs, Transformers",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 14,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Properties & Advantages:\n• Piecewise linear function\n• Derivative: 0 for x<0, 1 for x>0\n• Highly efficient computation & sparse activation\n• Fast convergence in SGD\n• Applications: CNNs, MLPs, Transformers",
