      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Properties & Applications:\n• Output probabilities sum exactly to 1.0\n• Fully differentiable for multi-class cross-entropy loss\n• Applications: Multi-class Classification\n• Attention Mechanisms in Transformers\n• Final layer in Large Language Models (LLMs)",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
