      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "⚠ Warning: Vanishing Gradient\nWhen x becomes very positive or negative, gradients approach \nzero, severely slowing down learning during backpropagation.\nPros: Clear probabilistic interpretation.\nCons: Vanishing gradient, non-zero centered output.",
